{"id": "86356", "name": "פתרון משוואה מטריציונית AX=B עבור 2×2 (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>If</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{\\bf A}={{CT:0}},  {\\bf B} = {{CT:1}},\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>find a 2 by 2 matrix \\({\\bf X}\\) such that</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{\\bf A}\\cdot{\\bf X} = {\\bf B}.\\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\({\\bf X} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: each entry in its own box: a number, a fraction (e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) or an expression (e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>For matrix</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{\\bf A} = {{CT:0}}\\]</p><p>find the inverse</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{\\bf A^{-1}} = {{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>Then</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{\\bf X} = {\\bf A^{-1}}\\cdot{\\bf B} ={{CT:2}} \\cdot {{CT:1}}={{CT:3}}\\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "